CHANGES IN VERSION 1.15.4
------------------------------

  o hypotesting: computation of 'fold change' now adapted to the transformation of the data (as a result, a previous call to 'transforming' is now required)
  o plot_hypotesting: new external method to plot volcano and boxplots/dotplots resulting from a statistical test
  o methods for ExpressionSet and MultiDataSet objects now deprecated

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.15.2
------------------------------

  o annotating method deprecated (call to ChEBI API not always responding)

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.7.8
------------------------------

  o hypotesting: new parameter checks

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.7.6
------------------------------

  o hypotesting: bug fix for MultiAssayExperiment objects

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.7.4
------------------------------

  o writing: bug fix when writing MultiAssayExperiment with single colData column

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.7.2
------------------------------

  o correcting: bug fix when removing features with 0 or NAs in all reference samples

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.3.8
